  "notes": "USAGE:\nDistinct from {介護|かいご} (nursing care), which covers broader long-term care including planning and management. {介助|かいじょ} focuses specifically on direct physical assistance. Common in healthcare and eldercare settings.\n\nCOMMON COLLOCATIONS:\n- {食事|しょくじ}{介助|かいじょ} (mealtime assistance)\n- {入浴|にゅうよく}{介助|かいじょ} (bathing assistance)\n- {歩行|ほこう}{介助|かいじょ} (walking assistance)\n- {介助|かいじょ}{犬|けん} (assistance dog)\n- {介助|かいじょ}{者|しゃ} (caregiver, assistant)",
